{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Kept: Expense &amp; Budget Tracker 是一款為 iPhone 與 Apple Watch 而設的記帳工具，主打兩下點擊即可完成一筆紀錄，並可透過 Wallet 自動化讓 Apple Pay 消費自動入帳。適合想隨手掌握開支、又不想逐項填寫長表格的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-40.webp\">\n<h2>兩按完成記帳與自動入帳</h2>\n<p>Kept 把記帳流程壓縮到極致：鍵盤、分類與當日總額同處一屏，輸入金額再點分類即完成，長按可補上帳戶、日期、備註與標籤。預先在捷徑設定 Wallet 自動化後，每次 Apple Pay 付款都會以待確認項目送達，商戶與卡片自動填好，類別沿用上次選擇，新商戶則交由你決定。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-72-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-73-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-74-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-75-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-76-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Kept: Expense &amp; Budget Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:29.547489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:12:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:37.916895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:43.172947+00:00","content_hash":"21b69dadc7897a53ecdc0ff724f0ef79403ffbdeedd350c40db2b1f842a3986d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}